ng the Elunori portfolio website.</p><div class=\"nv-meta\">Last updated: 21 September 2026 · Portfolio demonstration</div></div></header><main class=\"nv-legal-body\"><div><aside class=\"nv-notice\"><strong>Important:</strong> Elunori is a fictional brand and these terms are sample portfolio content. They are not legal advice and must be reviewed, localised and approved before any public or commercial launch.</aside><h2>1. About these terms</h2><p>These terms describe the intended rules for visiting and using a future Elunori website. The current site is a local demonstration created to present a WordPress portfolio project.</p><h2>2. Use of the website</h2><p>You may browse the site for personal, informational and evaluation purposes. You should not attempt to disrupt the website, gain unauthorised access, introduce harmful code, scrape protected content at scale or use the site in a way that violates applicable law.</p><h2>3. Product information</h2><p>Flow, Move and Pocket are fictional product concepts. Descriptions, interfaces, availability and store buttons are illustrative and do not represent products currently offered for sale or download.</p><h2>4. Intellectual property</h2><p>Unless otherwise stated, the Elunori name, visual system, copy and demonstration layouts are presented as original portfolio material. A production version should specify ownership, licensing and permitted reuse in full.</p><h2>5. Contact form submissions</h2><p>When submitting the contact form, you agree to provide information you are authorised to share and not to send unlawful, harmful or unsolicited content. Submission does not create a client relationship, contract or obligation to provide services.</p><h2>6. External and placeholder links</h2><p>App Store, Google Play and social links may be placeholders in this demonstration. They do not intentionally direct visitors to unrelated commercial services. Any future third-party links would be provided for convenience and governed by the destination provider’s own terms.</p><h2>7. Availability and changes</h2><p>The demonstration may be changed, paused or removed without notice. Features, content and visual details may evolve as the portfolio project is refined.</p><h2>8. Disclaimers</h2><p>The site and its content are provided for demonstration purposes without promises that they are complete, error-free or suitable for a particular commercial or legal use. Professional advice should be obtained where appropriate.</p><h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2><p>A production version would include limitations permitted by applicable law. This demonstration does not attempt to define enforceable limitations for a real company, customer relationship or jurisdiction.</p><h2>10. Governing law</h2><p>The governing law and dispute venue have intentionally not been specified because Elunori is not a registered operating company. They must be selected and documented before a real launch.</p><h2>11. Changes to these terms</h2><p>These demonstration terms may be updated as the project changes. A public version should display an effective date and explain how material changes will be communicated.</p><h2>12. Contact</h2><p>Questions about this portfolio project can be sent through the <a href=\"/contact\">Contact page</a>. Verified business and legal contact details should replace demonstration details before production release.</p><div class=\"nv-back\"><a href=\"/\">Back to Home</a></div></div></main></section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Terms & Conditions','','publish','closed','closed','','terms','','','2026-09-22 05:14:02','2026-09-22 05:14:02','',0,'http://novair-portfolio.local/?page_id=24',0,'page','',0),(26,1,'2026-09-22 05:09:26','2026-09-22 05:09:26','{\"fields\":{\"1\":{\"id\":\"1\",\"type\":\"name\",\"format\":\"simple\",\"label\":\"Name\",\"required\":\"1\",\"size\":\"large\"},\"2\":{\"id\":\"2\",\"type\":\"email\",\"label\":\"Email\",\"required\":\"1\",\"size\":\"large\"},\"