message below.</p></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"nv-contact-stop nv-contact-content\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull nv-contact-stop nv-contact-content\"><!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"nv-contact-panel\"><div class=\"nv-contact-shell nv-contact-grid\"><aside class=\"nv-contact-aside\"><h2>A clear starting point.</h2><p>Share a little context and the kind of conversation you would like to have. The form keeps the first step simple, focused and easy to complete on any device.</p><div class=\"nv-contact-details\"><div class=\"nv-contact-detail\"><span class=\"nv-contact-label\">PREVIEW CONTACT</span><span class=\"nv-contact-value\">Use the secure form on this page</span></div><div class=\"nv-contact-detail\"><span class=\"nv-contact-label\">STUDIO CONCEPT</span><span class=\"nv-contact-value\">Copenhagen-inspired · Remote-first</span></div><div class=\"nv-contact-detail\"><span class=\"nv-contact-label\">PROJECT STATUS</span><span class=\"nv-contact-value\">Portfolio concept · Pre-release</span></div></div><div class=\"nv-contact-note\"><strong>Preview note.</strong> Messages are processed locally for form testing. Public email delivery will be connected after the Elunori domain and verified sender are selected.</div><div class=\"nv-contact-back\"><a href=\"/\">← Back to Home</a></div></aside><div class=\"nv-contact-form\">\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[wpforms id=\"26\" title=\"false\" description=\"false\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class=\"nv-contact-required\">All fields are required. Privacy-friendly anti-spam protection is enabled.</p></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Contact','','publish','closed','closed','','contact','','','2026-09-23 11:55:14','2026-09-23 09:55:14','',0,'http://novair-portfolio.local/contact/',0,'page','',0),(51,0,'2026-09-22 10:14:40','